      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_batch.py` that moderates a batch of user messages and returns per-message decisions, I will use the Perspective API by Jigsaw, a service designed to detect toxic content in text. The Perspective API is a concrete external provider that can be identified in the code by its specific API endpoint and the use of its client library. </thinking>\n",
